WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.253 --> 00:00:10.193
I’d like to share with you guys a story.

00:00:10.193 --> 00:00:15.334
This story is about a girl, teenage girl,
like most of us,

00:00:15.334 --> 00:00:18.964
and she wanted to be a nurse

00:00:18.964 --> 00:00:24.170
because she felt very pleased 
to take care and help people.

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:28.294
Well, one day, 
she was going to travel by plane,

00:00:28.294 --> 00:00:32.272
and she had the opportunity 
to fall in love with that huge machine

00:00:32.272 --> 00:00:35.164
that makes people fly around the world.

00:00:35.164 --> 00:00:37.913
She was quite confused because

00:00:37.913 --> 00:00:44.264
how could she manage those passions
she had of taking care of people

00:00:44.264 --> 00:00:46.784
and flying at the same time?

00:00:46.784 --> 00:00:48.424
How could she do this?

00:00:48.424 --> 00:00:50.793
When she entered the airplane,

00:00:50.793 --> 00:00:54.494
she saw a very good-looking 
woman wearing uniform

00:00:54.494 --> 00:00:59.844
helping people to find their seats 
with a beautiful smile in her face,

00:00:59.844 --> 00:01:02.343
and she decided to be like her someday.

00:01:02.343 --> 00:01:04.833
She wanted to be a flight attendant,

00:01:04.833 --> 00:01:08.774
to have these opportunities
to fly everyday,

00:01:08.774 --> 00:01:11.464
to feel this freedom,

00:01:11.464 --> 00:01:15.153
and to be with different people
of different places

00:01:15.153 --> 00:01:17.864
and far places, too every day.

00:01:17.864 --> 00:01:20.584
Okay, that was her dream.

00:01:20.584 --> 00:01:24.416
Well, a dream for us 
can mean lots of things.

00:01:24.416 --> 00:01:29.635
It can be something that happens inside
our head while we are sleeping,

00:01:29.635 --> 00:01:31.834
It can be also a compliment.

00:01:31.834 --> 00:01:35.264
You can go to the person 
you have a crush on

00:01:35.264 --> 00:01:42.526
and say to him or her that,
"oh my god, you're a dream."

00:01:42.526 --> 00:01:45.185
But it also can be an ambition,

00:01:45.185 --> 00:01:48.194
and that's what 
we are talking about today.

00:01:48.194 --> 00:01:51.816
An ambition is the strong desire
to reach something,

00:01:51.816 --> 00:01:57.244
and I believe that there are a range 
of factors that can determine

00:01:57.244 --> 00:02:00.004
whether or not we will reach our dreams.

00:02:00.004 --> 00:02:03.713
Some of them are 
the self-esteem we receive,

00:02:03.713 --> 00:02:06.225
the will to succeed we have,

00:02:06.225 --> 00:02:08.484
the support we receive,

00:02:08.484 --> 00:02:13.325
and the reality, 
our realistic vision, actually.

00:02:13.325 --> 00:02:18.825
And to make this way of thinking
easier for us,

00:02:18.825 --> 00:02:23.965
I decided to turn all these factors
into a math equation,

00:02:23.965 --> 00:02:27.723
although I'm not as good 
at math as I wish.

00:02:27.723 --> 00:02:31.141
The equation was like this:

00:02:31.141 --> 00:02:38.063
Y times Z times W times R equals X,

00:02:38.063 --> 00:02:39.735
it's very simple,

00:02:39.735 --> 00:02:44.305
where Y is your self-esteem,

00:02:44.305 --> 00:02:46.094
Z is the support you receive,

00:02:46.094 --> 00:02:48.614
W is your will to succeed,

00:02:48.614 --> 00:02:50.454
R is your realistic vision

00:02:50.454 --> 00:02:54.044
and X is your ambition, your dream.

00:02:54.044 --> 00:02:59.164
Interpreting this equation,
we can see that every factor is essential.

00:02:59.164 --> 00:03:04.203
There are two observations
that I'd like to tell you guys.

00:03:04.203 --> 00:03:08.975
The first one is 
if you pay attention here,

00:03:08.975 --> 00:03:14.776
you can see that if there is only
one negative unknown in this equation,

00:03:14.776 --> 00:03:20.044
it can mess up everything in your life.

00:03:20.044 --> 00:03:24.054
For example, if you have self-esteem,

00:03:24.054 --> 00:03:26.373
you receive the support,

00:03:26.373 --> 00:03:28.581
you have will to succeed,

00:03:28.581 --> 00:03:31.310
you have also an awesome realistic vision,

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:34.137
but if you don't have 
an ambition in your life,

00:03:34.137 --> 00:03:36.024
you have no focus.

00:03:36.024 --> 00:03:39.325
It’s like you’re running as fast 
as you can with everything

00:03:39.325 --> 00:03:42.358
but you don’t know where you’re going.

00:03:42.358 --> 00:03:44.775
Another observation,

00:03:44.775 --> 00:03:47.035
if you have the support,

00:03:47.035 --> 00:03:49.332
also the will to succeed,

00:03:49.332 --> 00:03:52.303
you have an awesome realistic vision,

00:03:52.303 --> 00:03:54.194
and you also have an ambition,

00:03:54.194 --> 00:03:57.568
but you don't have self-esteem,

00:03:57.568 --> 00:04:02.724
you will hardly reach your dreams
because you won't feel able enough for it

00:04:02.724 --> 00:04:05.844
and if you reach it, 
although it's a victory,

00:04:05.844 --> 00:04:08.964
you won't feel completely satisfied
with yourself

00:04:08.964 --> 00:04:11.625
because you'll feel 
there's a part of you missing.

00:04:11.625 --> 00:04:15.634
Another point that
I'd like to share with you

00:04:15.634 --> 00:04:20.726
is that the only external element
that is here in this equation

00:04:20.726 --> 00:04:23.254
is the support we receive.

00:04:23.254 --> 00:04:26.305
This support we receive 
is directly related

00:04:26.305 --> 00:04:29.354
to our society and what it enforces.

00:04:29.354 --> 00:04:32.773
So when we are called to do something,

00:04:32.773 --> 00:04:39.654
something that we never saw someone
like us, apparently like us, doing,

00:04:39.654 --> 00:04:42.424
you won't feel able enough to do it.

00:04:42.424 --> 00:04:44.775
Can you understand that?

00:04:44.775 --> 00:04:51.434
So I'd like to ask you guys a question.

00:04:51.434 --> 00:04:58.044
How much support do you get from
this current society?

00:04:58.044 --> 00:05:00.504
Getting back to our story,

00:05:00.504 --> 00:05:06.875
our protagonist, she didn't receive
a lot of support from society.

00:05:06.875 --> 00:05:13.454
She decided to search more about
this career that she wanted to have,

00:05:13.454 --> 00:05:20.235
and she realized some huge variations
between her

00:05:20.235 --> 00:05:23.795
and the idea of flight attendant

00:05:23.795 --> 00:05:27.054
according to this current society.

00:05:27.054 --> 00:05:30.894
This current society, in her thoughts,

00:05:30.894 --> 00:05:39.794
couldn't agree with the idea of
a black-skinned woman with curly braided hair

00:05:39.794 --> 00:05:42.792
to be a flight attendant.

00:05:42.792 --> 00:05:45.934
Of course, she was sad about it.

00:05:45.934 --> 00:05:49.758
She couldn't do, be, or live
the way she wanted to

00:05:49.758 --> 00:05:51.524
because of her apperance.

00:05:51.524 --> 00:05:55.486
She decided to quit 
about this dream she had.

00:05:55.486 --> 00:05:57.864
One day at her school,

00:05:57.864 --> 00:06:03.034
she was going to an event,
a vocational guidance,

00:06:03.034 --> 00:06:08.554
and the special guest
in this vocational guidance

00:06:08.554 --> 00:06:11.065
was a British guy.

00:06:11.065 --> 00:06:14.312
While the event was going on,
he was paying attention to her,

00:06:14.312 --> 00:06:17.004
and that was kind of weird to her.

00:06:17.004 --> 00:06:20.354
And when the conversation moment arrived,

00:06:20.354 --> 00:06:24.026
she told him she was almost giving up
on her dream,

00:06:24.026 --> 00:06:29.963
but she didn't tell him why
and what was her dream.

00:06:29.963 --> 00:06:31.856
At the end of the event,

00:06:31.856 --> 00:06:35.834
he took her hand, looked her in the eyes
and said,

00:06:35.834 --> 00:06:38.422
"I believe in you. 
I believe in your talent

00:06:38.422 --> 00:06:43.775
Please don't give up on your dream.
I believe in you."

00:06:43.775 --> 00:06:45.992
She was shocked, of course.

00:06:45.992 --> 00:06:47.645
Who wouldn't be?

00:06:47.645 --> 00:06:51.725
Because that man went from so far
to tell her so simple words

00:06:51.725 --> 00:06:56.824
and at the same time,
so intense words for her.

00:06:56.824 --> 00:07:03.254
Based on this support,
she decided to take a risk.

00:07:03.254 --> 00:07:09.794
She decided to take an exam
called General Aircraft Knowledge,

00:07:09.794 --> 00:07:15.289
and this exam you must take
if you want to be a flight attendant,

00:07:15.289 --> 00:07:18.294
and she was approved on it.

00:07:18.294 --> 00:07:24.203
That girl I told you the story about
was me two years ago.

00:07:24.203 --> 00:07:29.573
I am a black-skinned girl 
with curly braided hair

00:07:29.573 --> 00:07:32.644
from the suburb of Rio in Brazil,

00:07:32.644 --> 00:07:40.016
and I'm now believing again in my dream
to become a flight attendant.

00:07:40.016 --> 00:07:44.895
I couldn't believe in the dream before
because my equation wasn't complete.

00:07:44.895 --> 00:07:51.003
But I know I wouldn't be here
believing in this dream again

00:07:51.003 --> 00:07:57.144
if it weren't for awesome people in
my life supporting me in different ways,

00:07:57.144 --> 00:07:58.503
like my family,

00:07:58.503 --> 00:07:59.786
my friends,

00:07:59.786 --> 00:08:04.714
all of you, for sure.

00:08:04.714 --> 00:08:11.794
And there is one thing
that I'd like to share with you.

00:08:11.794 --> 00:08:16.315
I'd like to say that 
in this current society,

00:08:16.315 --> 00:08:29.425
I am part of the dreamers club.

00:08:29.425 --> 00:08:30.294
I dream,

00:08:30.294 --> 00:08:31.326
I make dreams,

00:08:31.326 --> 00:08:34.454
and I love to help people 
with their dreams, too

00:08:34.454 --> 00:08:40.254
So there are two questions 
that I'd like to make for you guys.

00:08:40.254 --> 00:08:46.545
Are you a dreamer in this current society
and you help people's dreams, too?

00:08:46.545 --> 00:08:52.333
Or are you just another face
in the crowd that can't dream anymore?

00:08:52.333 --> 00:08:56.633
Henry Ford is often reported 
to have said that:

00:08:56.633 --> 00:08:59.914
“When everything seems to be against you,

00:08:59.914 --> 00:09:04.355
remember that the plane takes off 
against the Wind, not with it.”

00:09:04.355 --> 00:09:08.654
I don’t know how the wind 
is blowing for you today,

00:09:08.654 --> 00:09:12.823
but I know you’ll solve the equation
that’s in your life

00:09:12.823 --> 00:09:14.509
that I showed you before

00:09:14.509 --> 00:09:18.185
and you will reach every dream
that are inside your heart.

00:09:18.185 --> 00:09:19.861
Thank you.

